WEBVTT

00:00:03.194 --> 00:00:06.036
Open Interaction Center, Opportunities.

00:00:06.036 --> 00:00:11.404
The list shows the open opportunities, with the account, the stage, the amount,

00:00:11.404 --> 00:00:13.994
the probability and the close date.

00:00:14.445 --> 00:00:16.022
Search with terms.

00:00:16.022 --> 00:00:21.342
Stage finds a stage by name, Closed finds closed or open opportunities, Won

00:00:21.342 --> 00:00:26.465
finds the ones that were won, and Account finds the deals of an account.

